From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryson <10244083+brysonwf@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 09:55:44 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dp: add qcom,sm8150-dp without wide bus

SM8150 (DPU 5.0) has no DP wide bus: with the sc7180/sm8350 descriptor the picture on an external monitor is
sheared. Use the sdm845 descriptor for qcom,sm8150-dp.

This patch was written by Claude (Anthropic's AI assistant) under the direction of Bryson, who reviewed and
tested it on a Surface Duo.

Signed-off-by: Bryson <10244083+brysonwf@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c
index 9bd9cd5c1..7f97a129c 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dp/dp_display.c
@@ -205,6 +205,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id msm_dp_dt_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sc8280xp-dp", .data = &msm_dp_desc_sc8280xp },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sc8280xp-edp", .data = &msm_dp_desc_sc8280xp },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sdm845-dp", .data = &msm_dp_desc_sdm845 },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8150-dp", .data = &msm_dp_desc_sdm845 },	/* Duo: no wide bus on DPU 5.0 */
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8350-dp", .data = &msm_dp_desc_sc7180 },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8650-dp", .data = &msm_dp_desc_sm8650 },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,x1e80100-dp", .data = &msm_dp_desc_x1e80100 },
